OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of holiday lets operating
OL,4,Awithout planning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of holiday let properties are
OL,7,Foperating in Edinburgh despite being
OL,8,Frefused planning permission, new
OL,9,Ffigures show.
OL,11,FAnalysis from housing campaigners
OL,12,Fsuggests that 800 of the 1,754 entire
OL,13,Fhomes in the city which are licensed
OL,14,Fshort-term lets (STLs) have had
OL,15,Fplanning applications refused.
OL,17,FBut because they have a licence they
OL,18,Fcan continue advertising the properties
OL,19,Fthrough websites such as Airbnb.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
