OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of holiday lets operating
OL,4,Awithout planning permission
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners are calling for Edinburgh
OL,7,FCity Council to make more use of its
OL,8,Fenforcement powers, which include
OL,9,Ffining owners who do not have planning
OL,10,Fpermission, while operators say STL
OL,11,Flaws introduced in 2023 are not working
OL,12,Fproperly.
